    "title": "India's Cockroach Janta Party Protests Education Minister",
    "text": "• Supporters of India's viral Cockroach Janta Party protested on Saturday.\n• The protest was held near Parliament in New Delhi.\n• Hundreds of students and young supporters participated in the protest.\n• The protest was to demand the resignation of the education minister.\n• The demand was over allegations of examination irregularities and repeated paper leaks.\n• The protest added to the pressure on Prime Minister Narendra Modi's government.\n• The protest also sought wider support among Indians.",
